*** Add File:README_HARDENING_ACTIONS.md
+HARDENING ACTIONS (summary)
+
+This patch implements concrete mitigations for the prioritized risks:
+
+- Sandbox escape / unwanted network access:
+  - RuntimeClass (kata) to schedule sandbox pods on isolated node pool.
+  - Seccomp profile + AppArmor profile templates for executor pods.
+  - NetworkPolicy limiting egress from sandbox namespace.
+  - Enforce allowlist images via cosign image-signature admission webhook.
+
+- Unsigned or tampered executor images:
+  - Admission webhook verifies cosign signatures; CI workflow (.github/workflows/enforce_signed_images.yml) checks images found in manifests on PR/push.
+  - cosign public key secret template provided.
+
+- Verifier mis-calibration:
+  - calculate_thresholds.py and periodic calibration workflow to compute thresholds from labeled corpora and produce calibration reports.
+
+- Vector DB failure/loss:
+  - Milvus production values, backup CronJob and simple restore-test Job + placeholder scripts for restore verification.
+
+- Webhook availability:
+  - webhook deployment configured for HA (replicas, probes), fail-open vs fail-closed controlled by FAIL_ON_ERROR env var, and CA rotation script to automate CA renewal.
+
+- PII leakage:
+  - Redaction checker + CronJob to run periodic redaction verification and report to MCP; originals encryption/retrieval flows remain in repo and should be enforced via A2A for retrieval.
+
+Next operator steps:
+1. Install kata runtime and create sandbox node pool, label nodes and cordon appropriately.
+2. Mount seccomp and AppArmor profiles on nodes and configure Pod specs to reference them.
+3. Provide cosign public key in secret kube-system/cosign-key and patch ValidatingWebhookConfiguration caBundle with generated CA from rotate_webhook_ca.sh.
+4. Provide labeled calibration CSV at services/verifier/calibration/labeled.csv and run calibration workflow; tune CROSS_ENCODER_MIN_SCORE from the report.
+5. Deploy Milvus with helm using k8s/milvus/values-production.yaml, configure S3 for backups and run restore test job.
+6. Build and push Docker images (image-webhook, milvus-backup, redaction-checker).
+
